  m_Name: BogAndBoneBreach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::WardBreachDefinition
  displayName: Bog and Bone
  warningText: The ground itself complains. Something large is rooting at the edge of the ward, and the dead walk behind it. Three roads now, and walls will not hold them all.
  pendingText: The bog has risen against us. Finish your walls. Say the word, and I will let them come.
  startHint: Boars, spitters and draugar will come
  wonText: The bog sinks back and the bones lie still. They will remember this home, and so will you.
  failedText: The ward gives. What came out of the bog goes back to it, for now, and leaves its mark on you.
  availableAfterExtractions: 1
  threatensHome: 1
